sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev
    participant lex as lex CLI
    participant dns as DNS
    participant plc as PLC Directory
    participant pds as Statusphere PDS

    Dev->>lex: lex install xyz.statusphere.status
    lex->>dns: TXT query _lexicon.statusphere.xyz
    dns->>lex: did=did:plc:cgglmcdlre7x4iknufqyajbo
    lex->>plc: Resolve DID
    plc->>lex: DID document (PDS endpoint + signing key)
    lex->>pds: com.atproto.sync.getRecord
    Note over lex,pds: collection: com.atproto.lexicon.schema<br/>rkey: xyz.statusphere.status
    pds-->>lex: CAR file (signed commit + MST blocks)
    Note over lex: Verify commit signature<br/>Traverse MST → extract record<br/>Validate lexicon document
    lex->>Dev: Write lexicons/ + lexicons.json
